From f49b7004b3de5319d88ab5721acb0ca315712fc6 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Tangelo Dev <tangelo-dev@noreply.invalid>
Date: Thu, 29 Oct 2026 19:09:27 +0100
Subject: [PATCH] ndm: pass a game's StreetPass/SpotPass-only daemon pause on
 unchanged (Build 131)

Nintendogs + Cats with the online LLE modules on said "StreetPass cannot be
activated" for the photo, message and present, although its StreetPass box
(00030b00) was complete. Before it touches its box the game asks NDM to
pause StreetPass only (ndm:u SuspendDaemons, mask 0x1). Since 0111 Tangelo
strips the StreetPass and SpotPass bits from a game's pause, which left mask
0; the real NDM refuses that (0xD8E06BED) and the game gives up.

A pause or resume whose mask has nothing but the StreetPass/SpotPass bits now
goes to NDM unchanged; requests that also pause other daemons are still cut
down as before.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01FYz3krf43qKGY6aS2Z5snz
---
 BUILD-NUMBER                | 2 +-
 src/core/hle/kernel/ipc.cpp | 6 +++++-
 2 files changed, 6 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/BUILD-NUMBER b/BUILD-NUMBER
index fd03ab2..a57f6ce 100644
--- a/BUILD-NUMBER
+++ b/BUILD-NUMBER
@@ -1 +1 @@
-130
+131
diff --git a/src/core/hle/kernel/ipc.cpp b/src/core/hle/kernel/ipc.cpp
index 0d0b436..1842dfc 100644
--- a/src/core/hle/kernel/ipc.cpp
+++ b/src/core/hle/kernel/ipc.cpp
@@ -163,10 +163,14 @@ Result TranslateCommandBuffer(Kernel::KernelSystem& kernel, Memory::MemorySystem
     // let them run again. Started from the game list there's neither, so SpotPass and StreetPass
     // never run in the background. A game's request keeps pausing nim only; its matching
     // ResumeDaemons (0x0007) is cut down the same way so NDM's pause counts stay balanced.
+    // A request for StreetPass and/or SpotPass only is passed on unchanged: the real NDM refuses
+    // an empty mask (0xD8E06BED), and a game that pauses just StreetPass (Nintendogs + Cats, mask
+    // 0x1) does so while it sets up or edits its own StreetPass box, then resumes it; with the
+    // refusal it reported "StreetPass cannot be activated" (2026-10-29).
     if (!reply && dst_process->GetName() == "ndm" &&
         (header.raw == 0x00060040 || header.raw == 0x00070040) &&
         src_process->codeset && (src_process->codeset->program_id >> 32) == 0x00040000 &&
-        (cmd_buf[1] & 0x3) != 0) {
+        (cmd_buf[1] & 0x3) != 0 && (cmd_buf[1] & ~0x3u) != 0) {
         LOG_INFO(Service_BOSS,
                  "{} asks NDM to {} background daemons 0x{:X}: leaving SpotPass and "
                  "StreetPass running (0x{:X})",
-- 
